<title>JAPAN: Japan end-June kerosene stocks up 28.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan end-June kerosene stocks up 28.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's kerosene stockpile stood at 2.99 million kl as of the end of June, up 28.0 percent from a year earlier but down 4.1 percent from May, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Demand for kerosene, used for heating, peaks in Japan during the four-month period from November to February.</p>
</text>
